OL,5,G0100 #Text Me When You Get Home
OL,6,     FWhen Becky Koster returns home
OL,7,     Ffrom a night out, she texts her
OL,8,     Fmother Barbara that she came back
OL,9,     Fsafely. Barbara recalls the search
OL,10,     Ffor her daughter when she was not
OL,11,     Ffound at home.
OL,12,G0155 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FThe first episode of the new
OL,14,     Fseries features a lipoma so large
OL,15,     Fit may not be safe to tackle under
OL,16,     Flocal anaesthetic, and a woman
OL,17,     Fwho's had alopecia for over 20
OL,18,     Fyears.
